      "content": "# usdx.money\n\n## EN\n\n- [Meet USDX](https://docs.usdx.money/meet-usdx.md): A Synthetic USD stablecoin\n- [USDX Basics](https://docs.usdx.money/a-synthetic-usd/usdx-basics.md)\n- [Delta-Neutral Stability](https://docs.usdx.money/a-synthetic-usd/delta-neutral-stability.md)\n- [Delta-Neutral Examples](https://docs.usdx.money/a-synthetic-usd/delta-neutral-examples.md)\n- [Peg Arbitrage Mechanism](https://docs.usdx.money/a-synthetic-usd/peg-arbitrage-mechanism.md)\n- [Security Updates](https://docs.usdx.money/a-synthetic-usd/security-updates.md)\n- [Staking USDX](https://docs.usdx.money/a-yield-bearing-token/staking-usdx.md)\n- [Yield Explanation](https://docs.usdx.money/a-yield-bearing-token/yield-explanation.md): Exploring How sUSDX Distributes the Protocol's Yield to Users\n- [User Security Measures](https://docs.usdx.money/a-yield-bearing-token/user-security-measures.md)\n- [How to Buy USDX?](https://docs.usdx.money/guides/how-to-buy-usdx.md)\n- [How to Redeem?](https://docs.usdx.money/guides/how-to-redeem.md)\n- [How to Participate in Staking?](https://docs.usdx.money/guides/how-to-participate-in-staking.md)\n- [Contracts](https://docs.usdx.money/informaiton/contracts.md)\n- [Audit](https://docs.usdx.money/informaiton/audit.md)\n- [Oracles](https://docs.usdx.money/informaiton/oracles.md)\n"
